        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kristin Davis, Darren Star\n- Works: Melrose Place, Sex and the City\n- Organizations: HBO\n\nFacts:\n- Kristin Davis, also listed as Kristin Lee Davis, was born on February 23, 1965, and is an American actress.\n- Kristin Davis played Brooke Armstrong on the soap opera Melrose Place from 1995 to 1996.\n- Sex and the City was an American romantic comedy television series created by Darren Star and produced by HBO.\n- Kristin Davis played Charlotte York Goldenblatt on HBO's Sex and the City from 1998 to 2004.\n- Sex and the City was broadcast from 1998 until 2004, and its original run had 94 episodes.",
